{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many pairs of positive integers (a,b) with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4734edbd9e3943c71d86a2c54ff8c09d4f00f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b\\le 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" /> satisfy the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e141f8438cc8bcf014c0f636e2f4433b1da2d5d3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+b^{-1}}{a^{-1}+b}=13?\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba51bdbb95fc00edacd98f270369c83325a8b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 1\\quad \\text{(B) } 5\\quad \\text{(C) } 7\\quad \\text{(D) } 9\\quad \\text{(E) } 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"272\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" /> We can rewrite the left-hand side as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74aa4536eecf7ba1479d87423772825f6a450108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2b+a}{b+ab^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"59\" height=\"40\" /> by multiplying the numerator and denominator by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />. Now we can multiply the top part of the fraction by the denominator to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb33dd080f7ce2907ba7d7cbd71b9a316cc2c57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2b+a = 13b + 13ab^2 \\implies ab(a-13b)=13b-a = -(a-13b) \\implies (ab+1)(a-13b) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"720\" height=\"19\" />. Now, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive, we cannot have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/c/a9c1b6a1da4d7667a87c7c8f7a782ea5a5dacd87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, so we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddc121221783d03c6759991a7fe3f8713472c949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-13b=0 \\implies a=13b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"200\" height=\"13\" />, so the solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/4/dc40034d46db9d1953bcfb0a3cd884a7f4ef7aeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(13,1), (26,2), (39,3), (52,4), (65,5), (78,6), (91,7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"18\" />, which is 7 ordered pairs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787579db16e3a7c0114484aa93845c66f040e85d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+\\frac{1}{b}}{\\frac{1}{a}+b}=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"88\" height=\"47\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663dfbfe87c56faa40209683573848b54ae79fa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{ab+1}{b}}{\\frac{ab+1}{a}}=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"79\" height=\"48\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cdd1b6020d06e128ebbf864c96f69863d687dd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />s cancel out leaving us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4ecdf6f88ceab49e9b9d764e2caff9ba98e0be4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"33\" />. This is asking us for the positive multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, and we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1fdf20f0bb89111a5e5ff4e487bdbdc37d33c6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 \\cdot 7 = 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017041524\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 171/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3839/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.059      1 -total\n 63.34%    8.905      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 35.02%    4.924      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12960:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017041524 and revision id 163865. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}